{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は11/17 お茶会とサイン会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったのですがそれと同時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんと幸奈の卒業でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい話からするか悩むな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんとはオーディションの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3次審査からずっと一緒でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然周りの環境に溶け込めず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4次審査の時にバスの席に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣に座りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢が同じっていうところで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く話しやすく、はじめて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会ったときから綺麗だな。って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね第一印象がこういう子に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出会ったことないってくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衝撃で....ダンスが上手く口では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言えなかったけど尊敬してたよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、おいでシャンプーで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に選抜入り出来た時も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一緒に選抜入りしようね♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってたからあたしに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっては凄い思い出のある曲。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん今までありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当更に綺麗になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもせっちゃんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんのままでいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欲しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/11/18/6134751/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして幸奈本当に勉強面などの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両立が凄く大変だった思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとあたしが思っているよりも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことに悩んだんだろうって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本人自身も言っていたけどあまり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事に来れない時もあったけどって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事面はあたし達でカバーして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸奈は幸奈なりに励めたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"励んで励んだけど卒業という形に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってしまったんだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あたしは目指すものがある"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸奈がとてもかっこよく見えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芯がしっかりしてるそんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸奈があたしは大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/11/18/6134751/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも今までありがとう♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな気持ちになれた昨日でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてサイン会とお茶会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです٩(๑❛ʚ❛๑)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","